flowchart TD
  Slow[Slow or failing feature?] --> Q1{Critical user path?}
  Q1 -->|No| Degrade[Graceful degradation: skip or queue; still save core]
  Q1 -->|Yes| Q2{Repeat reference data?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Cache[Platform Cache partition + CacheBuilder]
  Q2 -->|Hot Apex/SOQL| Limits[Bulkify, selective SOQL, async; check governors table]
  Limits --> Q3{Need production-like load proof?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Full[Scale Test in Full sandbox — not Developer sandbox]
  Q3 -->|No| Local[Unit tests plus Scale Center in current env]
